            "trait_name": {
              "value": "25"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "Fortitude save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature suffers no additional effect.\n- **Success:** The creature takes an additional 1d10 bludgeoning damage.\n- **Failure:** The creature takes an additional 2d10 bludgeoning damage and is knocked prone if it's Large or smaller.\n- **Critical Failure:** As failure, but without a size limit."
